COMPUTER - Computah OS library
(generated from docs/API.md)

The machine's computer library (LUA.md) plus:

computer.runlevel() -> number

Always 1 once the OS has booted (OpenOS reports
"S" while booting).

computer.getProgramLocations() -> table

Where programs that aren't installed could be
found (OpenOS uses this for hints). Computah OS
has none: returns {}.

Inside the OS, computer.pullSignal(timeout) waits
through the scheduler, so other threads keep
running while one waits; see process. Use
event.pull in programs.
